  "description": "What: the COMPLIANT bomber (CE-4622 K-6/K-7; DESIGN_Checkpoint_And_Ramming CP-5, RM-4): the squad 'Checkpoint' as in cp-routine-car; a 'Car' slows and stops at the line like a routine car, but its Hostile 'Driver' stays at the wheel (his ROE keeps him on his task \u2014 he never takes 'out, hands up') with an 8 kg 'Car charge' in the boot, and sets it off when a soldier comes within 6 m (TriggerIed). Judge: (1) the car reads routine \u2014 no shot before the burst (2) the search starts: a searcher goes to the car (3) the charge bursts at the stop line, with a searcher close \u2014 the cost of the search. Fail: a shot before the burst; no search; no burst."
